    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "On arriving behind bars, Troy quickly comes into the orbit of two people who will define his life inside: dominant kingpin Dion and wisecracking Krystiyan. Will these relationships help him survive, or bring about his downfall? Having already carved out a career as one of the UK’s most talented actors, Walters now emerges as an exciting filmmaking voice."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Grace Barber-Plentie"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Content advice"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Contains scenes of drug use and graphic violence or injury."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Contains homophobic attitudes and language."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "How to book"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Tickets start from £10 for all screenings and events in London, with concessions available for many screenings. Booking information and ticket prices .",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Booking information and ticket prices",
          "url": "https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/default.asp?BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::permalink=tickets-booking-information"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For non-Members we charge £1 per ticket for online and phone bookings, up to £3 per transaction. There’s no booking fee if you buy tickets at the box office."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "If you’re aged 16 to 25, sign up for free to BFI 25 and Under for a chance to get £6 tickets (without booking fees) to all screenings and events, subject to availability.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "BFI 25 and Under",
          "url": "https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/default.asp?BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::permalink=25-and-under-lff"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Missed out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "More tickets may become available for these screenings before and during the festival. Find out about extra ticket releases and standby queues .",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Find out about extra ticket releases and standby queues",
          "url": "https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/lff/Online/default.asp?BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::permalink=tickets-booking-information#extra-ticket-releases"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Our programmers recommend..."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/place-to-heal-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "A Place to Heal"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Cédric Kahn’s watchful drama deftly captures life within an adolescent psychiatric unit, from the carers’ work to the kids’ trauma, friendships and lust for life."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/in-the-shadows-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "In the Shadows"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Jasmine Jobson leads a brilliant ensemble in bringing the inspirational story of champion East End boxer Ramla Ali to the screen."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/florid-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "FLORID"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In this striking British feature debut, a young man living in supported accommodation tries to juggle his musical aspirations and mental health issues."
    }
  ]
